  "summary": "Several studies have directly applied gradient boosted trees to crop yield forecasting. El-Sayed et al. (2022) [V0037] used boosted decision-tree ensembles on AgriSat-4, achieving an AUROC of 0.75. Gupta et al. (2024) [V0039] reported an accuracy of 0.89 on CellLife. Fischer et al. (2023) [V0038] obtained an F1 score of 0.82 on LedgerGuard. Haddad et al. (2025) [V0040] achieved a test MAE of 0.61 on ToxiBench. Fischer et al. (2023) [V0035] also reported an F1 score of 0.78 on CellLife using decentralised training without pooled records.",
